    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it's not temporary. they've already made up their minds about me. i see the way they look at each other when they think i'm not looking. it's like they've collectively decided i'm the problem. there's no \"fixing\" this or talking it out. the damage is just... done. i feel like i'm just waiting for the world to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone. how do you even live like that? just being a shadow of someone people used to know?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
